# reheated_mass = ColdGas * (1 - 2^-28): the fused MetalsColdGas -= metallicity * reheated_mass
# (S:1168) leaves a residual the unfused form rounds differently. Constructed rounding-point
# fixture: a one-rounding difference in the expression it names reaches a float store, so a port
# that fuses, splits or regroups it differently fails here.
# Constructed input (not R0 output); every value is set explicitly. All flags and parameters are
# R0's unless a line says NOT R0.
